<title>USA: Associates Corp issues $300 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Associates Corp issues $300 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Associates Corp was priced on Wednesday, according to sole manager J.P. Morgan Securities.</p>
<p>Associates Corp is a consumer and commercial finance company which was wholly-owned by Ford Motor Co before a May, 1996, initial public offering.</p>
<p>BORROWER ASSOCIATES CORP</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 6.70 PCT   MATURITY 5/29/2001</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.83   FIRST PAY DATE 11/29/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S AA3   YIELD 6.749 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AA-MINUS			  CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1672))</p>
